<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.900" end="00:00:09.000" style="s2">Help me. Smash the vase and get me out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.600" end="00:00:13.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m totally broke. I wonder when I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.900" end="00:00:14.800" style="s2">finally get paid.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.500" end="00:00:16.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.800" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">stopped working again? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.400" end="00:00:19.700" style="s2">daydreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.800" end="00:00:22.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Arthur, when are you going to pay me</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.700" end="00:00:24.900" style="s2">the wages you promised?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.500" end="00:00:27.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paid? What are you rushing for? For the</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.900" end="00:00:29.100" style="s2">garbage work you do? No money today.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.800" end="00:00:31.100" style="s2">Maybe next month.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.100" end="00:00:33.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just sold a painting for $20,000</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.100" end="00:00:36.100" style="s2">yesterday. Why say you have no money?</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.100" end="00:00:38.200" style="s2">You&#39;re maliciously withholding my wages.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:41.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat, HOW DARE YOU TALK BACK</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.200" end="00:00:41.400" style="s2">TO ME? GET LOST.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:51.300" style="s2">YOU JINX. This is a 19th century</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:53.000" style="s2">Imperial piece. It&#39;s worth $50,000.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.300" end="00:00:54.500" style="s2">If you can&#39;t pay for it today, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.000" end="00:00:56.600" style="s2">calling the cops and putting you in</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.500" end="00:00:58.900" style="s2">jail.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.600" end="00:01:00.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh yeah, finally out of that cheap</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.900" end="00:01:03.500" style="s2">shell.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.200" end="00:01:03.500" style="s2">So comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.190" end="00:01:06.210" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.700" end="00:01:11.400" style="s2">The green patina on me was created</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.500" end="00:01:13.800" style="s2">yesterday by soaking me in sulfuric</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.400" end="00:01:15.700" style="s2">acid. It hurt like hell.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.800" end="00:01:17.900" style="s2">Don&#39;t look at me. My printer ink isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.700" end="00:01:19.700" style="s2">even dry yet. I was just shipped from a</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.900" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">factory last week.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.700" end="00:01:24.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I awakened the ability to hear what</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.800" end="00:01:27.600" style="s2">antiques are saying.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.700" end="00:01:31.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; QUIT PRETENDING YOU&#39;RE DEAD. PAY UP.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.600" end="00:01:33.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50,000, not a penny less.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.100" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50,000 for a mass produced factory</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.900" end="00:01:37.400" style="s2">knockoff?</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">Are you kidding me? Would a 19th century</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.400" end="00:01:40.100" style="s2">Imperial</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.400" end="00:01:41.600" style="s2">have microwave safe written in English</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.100" end="00:01:43.300" style="s2">on the inside?</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.600" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">And that masterpiece on the wall, you</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.300" end="00:01:46.300" style="s2">haven&#39;t even cleaned up the printer&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.600" end="00:01:48.900" style="s2">grid lines. Everything in this store</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.300" end="00:01:51.300" style="s2">combined isn&#39;t worth $200. Call the</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.900" end="00:01:53.700" style="s2">cops. Let&#39;s have the Consumer Bureau see</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.300" end="00:01:56.300" style="s2">who&#39;s really going to jail for fraud. I</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.700" end="00:01:59.800" style="s2">quit. Keep my last month&#39;s pay. Buy</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.300" end="00:01:59.800" style="s2">yourself a decent coffin with it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.100" end="00:02:03.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.592" end="00:02:05.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bottom metal shop girl totally</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.192" end="00:02:07.192" style="s2">unphased by a local snake. Find out</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.492" end="00:02:09.392" style="s2">everything about her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.192" end="00:02:11.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey girl, help me. Do not let my rusty</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.392" end="00:02:13.292" style="s2">exterior deceive you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.392" end="00:02:15.792" style="s2">Hidden inside this iron shell is a</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.292" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">flawless marble bust of a Greek saint. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.792" end="00:02:20.692" style="s2">am WORTH AT LEAST $5 MILLION.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:24.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A $5 million Greek bust? If I get this,</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.692" end="00:02:24.692" style="s2">I&#39;m rich. But I got to play it cool.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.092" end="00:02:27.992" style="s2">Boss, how much for this rusty lump of</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.492" end="00:02:29.492" style="s2">metal? This thing is such a piece of</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.992" end="00:02:30.192" style="s2">junk. I can&#39;t even make out its face</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:31.992" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.192" end="00:02:34.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, little girl, you have no eye for</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.992" end="00:02:36.592" style="s2">art. This is a genuine 15th century</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.692" end="00:02:38.492" style="s2">Renaissance bronze bust. Look at this</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.592" end="00:02:40.792" style="s2">patina. Look at the craftsmanship.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.492" end="00:02:42.792" style="s2">Absolute Medici family collection. If I</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.792" end="00:02:45.192" style="s2">wasn&#39;t tight on cash, I wouldn&#39;t sell it</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.792" end="00:02:48.092" style="s2">for $100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.192" end="00:02:49.292" style="s2">Today is your lucky day. $100,000. Take</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.092" end="00:02:52.592" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:55.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BLASPHEMY. ABSOLUTE [ __ ] I AM FROM</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.592" end="00:02:57.792" style="s2">THE HELLENISTIC PERIOD.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.492" end="00:03:00.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Renaissance bronze? Are you trying to</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.792" end="00:03:03.092" style="s2">scam me because I look young?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.792" end="00:03:06.292" style="s2">Renaissance bronzes have a dark, rich</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.092" end="00:03:08.092" style="s2">luster from the lost wax casting. This</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.292" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">thing is covered in floating rust. Look</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.092" end="00:03:12.392" style="s2">at the bottom. Those are obvious modern</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.892" end="00:03:13.992" style="s2">sand casting seam lines. Plus,</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.392" end="00:03:15.992" style="s2">Renaissance busts have prominent</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.992" end="00:03:18.392" style="s2">detailed features. This thing&#39;s face is</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.992" end="00:03:21.092" style="s2">literally crooked. Medici collection,</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.392" end="00:03:23.592" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you $500. Not a penny more.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.092" end="00:03:26.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $500? Are you robbing me? I paid more</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.592" end="00:03:28.492" style="s2">than that to get it. At least $5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.492" end="00:03:30.992" style="s2">Wait, wait, wait. Fine. Consider it my</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.492" end="00:03:31.992" style="s2">bad luck today. $500.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.992" end="00:03:35.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.992" end="00:03:35.592" style="s2">Now it&#39;s time to witness a miracle.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.792" end="00:03:38.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss,</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.992" end="00:03:40.192" style="s2">what do you need a sledgehammer that big</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.392" end="00:03:43.292" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.192" end="00:03:43.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smashing walnuts.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.092" end="00:03:50.392" style="s2">Time to smash.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.992" end="00:03:53.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. AIM FOR MY FOREHEAD. SMASH IT HARD.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.392" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">LET ME SEE THE SUN AGAIN.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.292" end="00:03:59.792" style="s2">YES. AIM RIGHT FOR MY FOREHEAD. SMASH IT</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.692" end="00:04:03.494" style="s2">HARD. LET ME SEE THE SUN AGAIN TODAY.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.792" end="00:04:03.494" style="s2">STOP RIGHT THERE, young lady.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.794" end="00:04:08.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, is that Master Sterling? The</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.694" end="00:04:10.594" style="s2">top appraiser in the antique district.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.894" end="00:04:13.594" style="s2">If Master Sterling is stepping in, could</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.594" end="00:04:15.594" style="s2">that rusty thing actually be a treasure?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.594" end="00:04:18.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady, looking at your attire, you</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.594" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">clearly aren&#39;t wealthy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.094" end="00:04:21.194" style="s2">500 is a lot of money for someone like</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.094" end="00:04:22.594" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.194" end="00:04:24.794" style="s2">That lump of iron you bought is a</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.594" end="00:04:26.494" style="s2">complete modern fake. If you smash it</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.794" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">open, you&#39;ll find nothing but industrial</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.494" end="00:04:29.494" style="s2">dirt inside.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.494" end="00:04:31.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? It&#39;s my money.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.494" end="00:04:33.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fate brought us together, and I have a</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:35.494" style="s2">soft heart for misguided youth. Tell you</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.294" end="00:04:38.294" style="s2">what, I&#39;ll cover your $500 and add an</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.494" end="00:04:40.594" style="s2">extra $100. Consider it charity.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.294" end="00:04:41.094" style="s2">Take this 600, go home, and find a real</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.594" end="00:04:43.094" style="s2">job.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.094" end="00:04:44.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You better thank Master Sterling. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.094" end="00:04:46.394" style="s2">making a profit on a piece of trash.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.894" end="00:04:47.694" style="s2">DON&#39;T PUSH YOUR LUCK, GIRL. You&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.394" end="00:04:48.494" style="s2">crying when you smash it and find</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.694" end="00:04:51.294" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.494" end="00:04:53.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charity? Dirt? How dare this blind fool</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.294" end="00:04:57.294" style="s2">insult my marble glory.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.594" end="00:04:59.194" style="s2">$600? I AM A PRICELESS PIECE OF HISTORY.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.294" end="00:05:01.494" style="s2">GIRL, SMASH ME NOW AND BLIND THIS</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.194" end="00:05:03.794" style="s2">ARROGANT PEASANT.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:05.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for the charity, Master Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.794" end="00:05:07.194" style="s2">But I&#39;m a bit stubborn.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.694" end="00:05:09.494" style="s2">Even if it is just scrap iron, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.194" end="00:05:10.694" style="s2">rather smash it just to hear the bang.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.494" end="00:05:11.494" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to concern yourself with</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.694" end="00:05:13.794" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.494" end="00:05:15.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ignorant brat. I am the absolute</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.794" end="00:05:17.194" style="s2">authority in this district. If I say</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.694" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">it&#39;s scrap, it&#39;s scrap.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.194" end="00:05:21.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you smash that and find even a penny</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.894" end="00:05:22.894" style="s2">of value inside, I will flip my gallery</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.094" end="00:05:23.994" style="s2">sign upside down.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.894" end="00:05:25.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.994" end="00:05:26.394" style="s2">Then you better keep your eyes wide</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.294" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">open.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.394" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T YOU DARE.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.094" end="00:05:40.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OH MY GOODNESS. LOOK AT THAT TEXTURE,</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.594" end="00:05:43.594" style="s2">THAT COLOR. That&#39;s authentic Pentelican</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.394" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">marble. It&#39;s a miracle. A flawless Greek</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.594" end="00:05:48.094" style="s2">saint bust. This must be worth at least</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.094" end="00:05:51.294" style="s2">$5 million.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.094" end="00:05:54.094" style="s2">$500 TURNED INTO 5 MILLION. This girl</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.294" end="00:05:56.594" style="s2">JUST HIT THE ULTIMATE JACKPOT. I&#39;M NOT</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.094" end="00:05:56.594" style="s2">SELLING.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.894" end="00:06:01.094" style="s2">I&#39;M NOT SELLING THIS BUST ANYMORE. GIVE</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.994" end="00:06:03.094" style="s2">IT BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.094" end="00:06:04.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S MINE NOW. What are you going to rob</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.094" end="00:06:04.895" style="s2">me in broad daylight?</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.494" end="00:06:07.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A deal</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.895" end="00:06:07.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is a deal. You can&#39;t back out now, you</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.195" end="00:06:10.195" style="s2">scoundrel.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.995" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master Sterling, don&#39;t forget to flip</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.195" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">your gallery&#39;s sign upside down when you</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.995" end="00:06:16.095" style="s2">get back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.495" end="00:06:18.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Truly impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.095" end="00:06:19.895" style="s2">My old eyes have indeed failed me today.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.395" end="00:06:22.395" style="s2">Young lady, your talent is</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.895" end="00:06:24.995" style="s2">extraordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.395" end="00:06:26.895" style="s2">Miss Serena, I admire your vision.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.995" end="00:06:29.195" style="s2">Tonight, there is a top-tier underground</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.895" end="00:06:30.895" style="s2">antique auction at the Grand Hotel. Only</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.195" end="00:06:32.995" style="s2">billionaires and top appraisers can</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.895" end="00:06:35.195" style="s2">attend. I sincerely invite you to be the</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.995" end="00:06:37.895" style="s2">chief appraiser for my gallery. Consider</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.195" end="00:06:40.495" style="s2">this VIP pass a welcome gift.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.895" end="00:06:42.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An underground auction?</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.495" end="00:06:45.495" style="s2">There must be more treasures there.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.295" end="00:06:47.595" style="s2">Maybe I can find an even bigger catch.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.495" end="00:06:49.095" style="s2">I&#39;ll take the pass. As for the job,</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.595" end="00:06:52.095" style="s2">we&#39;ll talk later.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.095" end="00:06:54.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, VIPs. Our first item tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.095" end="00:06:56.195" style="s2">an extremely rare, well-preserved</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.195" end="00:06:59.895" style="s2">18th-century medieval statue of a holy</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.195" end="00:07:01.295" style="s2">knight made entirely of solid golden. $3</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.895" end="00:07:02.495" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.295" end="00:07:03.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ian,</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.495" end="00:07:06.395" style="s2">what kind of surprise do you think our</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.995" end="00:07:08.195" style="s2">little wildcat will bring us tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.395" end="00:07:10.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This girl found a $5 million Greek bust</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.195" end="00:07:12.695" style="s2">in the antique street this afternoon.</p>
