<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:24.395" style="s2">LITERALLY HAVE A MADE-IN-PRCE BARBO</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.895" end="00:07:26.715" style="s2">ENGRAVED IN MY BUTT.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.395" end="00:07:28.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE THESE rich people blind?</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.715" end="00:07:28.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.895" end="00:07:33.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did this peasant come from,</p>
