<p begin="00:07:33.395" end="00:07:37.795" style="s2">Security, how did this uncultured trash</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.795" end="00:07:40.895" style="s2">get in?</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.795" end="00:07:44.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, ignore this bottom-pleat trash.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.895" end="00:07:44.295" style="s2">It lowers your status.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.895" end="00:07:48.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I laugh at whatever I want.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.995" end="00:07:50.795" style="s2">Mind your own business.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.495" end="00:07:53.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you? How dare you speak to my</p>
