<p begin="00:08:14.997" end="00:08:19.697" style="s2">That thing is a complete fake.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.097" end="00:08:21.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NONSENSE. THE WEIGHT, THE CRAFTSMANSHIP,</p>
