<p begin="00:08:24.697" end="00:08:29.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, I don&#39;t know how I offended you,</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.997" end="00:08:30.497" style="s2">but why must you curse my treasure?</p>
