<p begin="00:08:33.397" end="00:08:36.997" style="s2">even afford the air in here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.897" end="00:08:38.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SECURITY, THROW THIS CRAZY WOMAN OUT.</p>
