<p begin="00:14:46.301" end="00:14:51.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take this woman&#39;s trash bags and throw</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.901" end="00:14:52.501" style="s2">them into the basement storage room. And</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.001" end="00:14:54.801" style="s2">without my permission, she is banned</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.501" end="00:14:57.901" style="s2">from stepping foot on the second floor.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.801" end="00:14:57.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, young master.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.301" end="00:15:00.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow!</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.980" end="00:15:04.301" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:08.201" style="s2">Ouch! You You dare to hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.301" end="00:15:08.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your filthy hands off my things.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.101" end="00:15:13.801" style="s2">Zack Sinclair, right? Everything you</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.401" end="00:15:16.301" style="s2">just said in this room, I recorded it</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.801" end="00:15:18.201" style="s2">all. When the DNA results come out, I</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.301" end="00:15:20.201" style="s2">will play this directly for grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.201" end="00:15:22.101" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how the old man evaluates his</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.201" end="00:15:26.501" style="s2">wonderful grandson.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.101" end="00:15:26.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] YOU PLAYED ME!</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.001" end="00:15:36.501" style="s2">AH! IT HURTS! SISTER, why did YOU PUSH</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.101" end="00:15:36.501" style="s2">ME?</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.101" end="00:15:40.801" style="s2">EVEN IF YOU HATE ME FOR TAKING your</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.701" end="00:15:43.701" style="s2">place, you shouldn&#39;t have smashed Zack&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.801" end="00:15:46.401" style="s2">favorite antique vase. It&#39;s priceless.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:48.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Terrible acting.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.401" end="00:15:51.501" style="s2">Which eye of yours saw me push you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.701" end="00:15:53.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] I WAS LITERALLY FIRED AT A</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.501" end="00:15:56.301" style="s2">HIGH-TECH REPLICA KILN LAST MONTH. This</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.801" end="00:15:59.401" style="s2">green tea [ __ ] threw herself at me. She</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.301" end="00:16:02.001" style="s2">framed her. WHAT A SHAMELESS [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.401" end="00:16:04.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HA! THE witness and the physical</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.001" end="00:16:06.701" style="s2">evidence are both here. And you still</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.501" end="00:16:09.201" style="s2">dare to deny it? Get on your knees AND</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.701" end="00:16:11.601" style="s2">APOLOGIZE TO CHLOE RIGHT NOW, THEN GET</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.201" end="00:16:15.001" style="s2">THE HELL OUT OF THE SINCLAIR FAMILY.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.601" end="00:16:18.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ME, NEIL, Zack Sinclair, you are not</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.001" end="00:16:19.902" style="s2">just blind. Your brain is defective. Me?</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.902" end="00:16:23.302" style="s2">Neil?</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.902" end="00:16:25.902" style="s2">Zack Sinclair, you are not just blind.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.302" end="00:16:28.702" style="s2">Your brain is defective. Look closely at</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.902" end="00:16:30.702" style="s2">this shard. Authentic medieval European</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.702" end="00:16:31.702" style="s2">porcelain has a fine pure white clay</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.702" end="00:16:33.602" style="s2">body.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.702" end="00:16:35.002" style="s2">This piece&#39;s inner core is as rough as</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.602" end="00:16:37.202" style="s2">sandpaper.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.002" end="00:16:39.102" style="s2">And look at that glaze. It&#39;s blindingly</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.202" end="00:16:41.102" style="s2">glossy. That&#39;s an obvious sign of</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.102" end="00:16:43.402" style="s2">artificial aging using hydrofluoxic</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.102" end="00:16:45.502" style="s2">acid. A modern replica fired in a</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.402" end="00:16:47.102" style="s2">factory just last month.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.502" end="00:16:49.002" style="s2">And you worship it as a priceless</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.102" end="00:16:50.702" style="s2">antique?</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.002" end="00:16:53.502" style="s2">You&#39;ve completely disgraced the Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.702" end="00:16:53.502" style="s2">family name.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.702" end="00:16:57.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.802" end="00:16:59.502" style="s2">She&#39;s not only bullying me, but spouting</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.802" end="00:17:01.602" style="s2">nonsense to insult our family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.502" end="00:17:04.302" style="s2">antiques. I can&#39;t live like this</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.602" end="00:17:06.396" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.302" end="00:17:07.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby, what happened?</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.396" end="00:17:09.902" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.402" end="00:17:14.002" style="s2">Who dared to hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.902" end="00:17:16.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, this wild woman pushed Chloe and</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.002" end="00:17:18.302" style="s2">smashed my antique. We need to throw her</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.802" end="00:17:19.702" style="s2">out right now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.302" end="00:17:23.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE&#39;S A</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.702" end="00:17:23.702" style="s2">ENOUGH. Stop arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.902" end="00:17:30.702" style="s2">The DNA test results are out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.702" end="00:17:32.502" style="s2">It&#39;s written in black and white. She is</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.702" end="00:17:34.402" style="s2">indeed</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.502" end="00:17:36.702" style="s2">the biological daughter of the Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.402" end="00:17:38.002" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.702" end="00:17:39.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.002" end="00:17:40.102" style="s2">My</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.202" end="00:17:42.302" style="s2">sister?</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.102" end="00:17:44.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is indeed</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.302" end="00:17:44.802" style="s2">the biological daughter of the Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.302" end="00:17:46.502" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.802" end="00:17:48.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Biological daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.502" end="00:17:50.102" style="s2">Hearing those words come out of his</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.102" end="00:17:52.302" style="s2">mouth was colder than a business</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.102" end="00:17:55.502" style="s2">negotiation.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.302" end="00:17:56.602" style="s2">Is this the family I once hoped for?</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.502" end="00:17:59.802" style="s2">How pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.602" end="00:18:02.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, sister is finally back. I occupied</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.802" end="00:18:03.902" style="s2">her place for 22 years.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.002" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">I deserve to die.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.902" end="00:18:07.302" style="s2">I&#39;ll pack my bags right now and roll out</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:08.802" style="s2">of the Sinclair family. I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.302" end="00:18:11.802" style="s2">everything back to her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.802" end="00:18:13.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, what are you doing? Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.802" end="00:18:14.802" style="s2">Chloe, what nonsense are you talking</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.702" end="00:18:18.202" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.802" end="00:18:22.103" style="s2">You are mommy&#39;s precious baby.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.202" end="00:18:22.103" style="s2">No one can ever drive you away.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.903" end="00:18:26.803" style="s2">Serena, yes, you are my biological</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.703" end="00:18:29.903" style="s2">daughter, but Chloe has been raised by</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.803" end="00:18:31.603" style="s2">our side for 22 years. She&#39;s delicate,</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.903" end="00:18:33.603" style="s2">spoiled, and can&#39;t suffer the slightest</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.603" end="00:18:35.703" style="s2">grievance. The deep bond we have with</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:38.303" style="s2">her cannot be replaced by a mere piece</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.703" end="00:18:40.703" style="s2">of paper. So, what&#39;s your point, Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.303" end="00:18:43.203" style="s2">Sinclair? To protect Chloe&#39;s fragile</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.703" end="00:18:45.803" style="s2">heart, your true identity cannot be made</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.203" end="00:18:47.103" style="s2">public for now. To the outside world, we</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.803" end="00:18:49.003" style="s2">will only announce that you are a</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.103" end="00:18:50.503" style="s2">distant relative staying with us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.003" end="00:18:53.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And at home,</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.503" end="00:18:55.003" style="s2">you must always yield to Chloe. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.003" end="00:18:58.103" style="s2">you dare use your bloodline to bully</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.003" end="00:18:58.103" style="s2">her. Understood?</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.403" end="00:19:01.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.203" end="00:19:03.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have truly seen it all today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.603" end="00:19:05.803" style="s2">A biological daughter has to be hidden</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.703" end="00:19:07.703" style="s2">in the dark while a fake product is</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.803" end="00:19:10.103" style="s2">treated like a fragile, untouchable</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.703" end="00:19:12.703" style="s2">treasure. The family traditions of the</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.103" end="00:19:13.503" style="s2">Sinclair households truly make me sick</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.703" end="00:19:15.403" style="s2">to my stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.503" end="00:19:17.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you laughing at? Did you hear</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.403" end="00:19:19.503" style="s2">WHAT MOM SAID? I&#39;M WARNING YOU, CHLOE IS</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.403" end="00:19:21.603" style="s2">THE ONLY SISTER I ACKNOWLEDGE. YOU</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.503" end="00:19:23.703" style="s2">BETTER behave yourself. If you dare</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.603" end="00:19:25.803" style="s2">spout nonsense outside or try to steal</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.703" end="00:19:27.603" style="s2">anything from Chloe, I will be the first</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.803" end="00:19:28.803" style="s2">to destroy you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.603" end="00:19:30.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Steal?</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.803" end="00:19:32.103" style="s2">Do you honestly think I care about this</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.903" end="00:19:34.203" style="s2">rotting,</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.103" end="00:19:35.803" style="s2">stinking house? Even if you gave me the</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.203" end="00:19:38.603" style="s2">Sinclair fortune for free, I&#39;d consider</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.803" end="00:19:40.403" style="s2">it too dirty to touch.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.603" end="00:19:42.603" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. Keep hugging this liar,</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.403" end="00:19:43.703" style="s2">this fake product for the rest of your</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.603" end="00:19:45.303" style="s2">lives.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.703" end="00:19:47.603" style="s2">From the moment I walk out this door</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.303" end="00:19:49.903" style="s2">today, whether the Sinclair family lives</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.603" end="00:19:52.103" style="s2">or dies has absolutely nothing to do</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.903" end="00:19:54.903" style="s2">with me, Serena Lin.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.103" end="00:19:57.103" style="s2">Actually, a clean break is better. This</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.903" end="00:19:59.403" style="s2">way, when I personally destroy this</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.103" end="00:20:02.593" style="s2">green tea [ __ ] later, I won&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.403" end="00:20:03.103" style="s2">worry about any [ __ ] family times.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.593" end="00:20:04.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.103" end="00:20:07.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, MASTER!</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.103" end="00:20:09.803" style="s2">MADAM, it&#39;s terrible! Old Mr. Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.603" end="00:20:11.303" style="s2">the old master suddenly vomited blood</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.803" end="00:20:12.803" style="s2">and collapsed.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.303" end="00:20:15.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa,</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.803" end="00:20:16.603" style="s2">in this entire house,</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.103" end="00:20:19.803" style="s2">his eyes at the auction were the only</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.603" end="00:20:19.803" style="s2">ones that were sincere.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.303" end="00:20:24.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Sinclair, the old master&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.003" end="00:20:25.505" style="s2">vitals are dropping rapidly. His organs</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.105" end="00:20:27.105" style="s2">are failing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.505" end="00:20:29.005" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.105" end="00:20:31.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we can&#39;t find the cause. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.005" end="00:20:33.705" style="s2">completely bizarre. It&#39;s like his life</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.505" end="00:20:35.705" style="s2">force is just draining away out of</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.705" end="00:20:38.705" style="s2">nowhere.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.705" end="00:20:40.905" style="s2">Can&#39;t find the cause? I donate tens of</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.705" end="00:20:43.505" style="s2">millions to your hospital every year,</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.905" end="00:20:45.205" style="s2">and this is your answer?</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.505" end="00:20:47.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are we going to do</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.205" end="00:20:49.205" style="s2">if Dad passes away now? The Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.605" end="00:20:50.505" style="s2">family will lose its main pillar of</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.205" end="00:20:53.105" style="s2">power.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:54.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, please wake up, Grandpa. As</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.105" end="00:20:56.205" style="s2">long as you get better, I&#39;m willing to</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.505" end="00:20:59.405" style="s2">give up 10 years of my own life in</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.205" end="00:21:02.005" style="s2">exchange for your safety.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.405" end="00:21:05.705" style="s2">Please take my life instead.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.005" end="00:21:05.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, you are too kind.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.005" end="00:21:10.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old fool, you&#39;re better off dead.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.705" end="00:21:12.505" style="s2">Once you&#39;re dead, there will be no one</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.505" end="00:21:15.005" style="s2">left to support that peasant sister of</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.505" end="00:21:17.605" style="s2">mine. The entire Sinclair fortune will</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.005" end="00:21:19.405" style="s2">belong to me and my brother.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.605" end="00:21:22.205" style="s2">Something&#39;s not right. This isn&#39;t an</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.405" end="00:21:22.205" style="s2">illness at all.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.504" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.405" end="00:21:29.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Suck it dry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.305" end="00:21:30.905" style="s2">This old man&#39;s life force is delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.105" end="00:21:32.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone has tampered with this statue.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.905" end="00:21:34.005" style="s2">If I don&#39;t stop it, Grandpa won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.705" end="00:21:35.705" style="s2">survive the night.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.005" end="00:21:37.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of my way if you don&#39;t WANT HIM</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.705" end="00:21:39.105" style="s2">TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.505" end="00:21:40.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE YOU INSANE? THAT&#39;S GRANDPA&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.105" end="00:21:42.205" style="s2">FAVORITE ANTIQUE. Don&#39;t you dare touch</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.705" end="00:21:45.005" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.205" end="00:21:46.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.005" end="00:21:48.505" style="s2">Even if you hate Grandpa for not</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.405" end="00:21:50.005" style="s2">announcing your identity immediately,</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.505" end="00:21:51.405" style="s2">you can&#39;t vent your anger on his</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.005" end="00:21:54.305" style="s2">treasures.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.405" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">He&#39;s dying. How can you be so vicious?</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:57.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You jinx. This house has had no peace</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.705" end="00:21:59.905" style="s2">since you came back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.905" end="00:22:00.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guards, grab her. Throw her in the</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.905" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">basement.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.705" end="00:22:05.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bunch of idiots. You&#39;re helping the</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.705" end="00:22:07.105" style="s2">person who sold you count the money.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.305" end="00:22:08.605" style="s2">Since you won&#39;t listen to reason, let&#39;s</p>
