<p begin="00:30:18.410" end="00:30:22.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FAKE.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.510" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">IT&#39;S ALL FAKE. THAT VICIOUS [ __ ] CHLOE</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.110" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">TOOK ALL OUR MONEY AND RAN. PLEASE GIVE</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:27.810" style="s2">ME SOME TIME.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.510" end="00:30:29.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I ONLY care about the signature on the</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.810" end="00:30:30.910" style="s2">contract. Since you don&#39;t have the</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.810" end="00:30:34.110" style="s2">money,</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.910" end="00:30:34.110" style="s2">use your leg to pay the debt.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.910" end="00:30:37.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Break it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.951" end="00:30:39.971" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.712" end="00:30:49.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.112" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">my precious daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.312" end="00:30:54.312" style="s2">We were blind. We were scammed by that</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.512" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">venomous snake, Chloe. Please save us.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.312" end="00:30:58.112" style="s2">Pay off the loan sharks.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.712" end="00:30:59.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister, I was wrong. I&#39;m your real</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.112" end="00:31:01.312" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.512" end="00:31:03.612" style="s2">If you don&#39;t save me, they&#39;ll kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.312" end="00:31:05.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The day you chose the fake over me, I</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.612" end="00:31:07.912" style="s2">told you we were done.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.812" end="00:31:09.312" style="s2">You gave all your love and trust to a</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.912" end="00:31:11.912" style="s2">scammer.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.312" end="00:31:14.312" style="s2">Now you are paying the price.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.912" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">It&#39;s called karma.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.312" end="00:31:19.912" style="s2">Security, clear out this irrelevant</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.912" end="00:31:19.912" style="s2">trash. Don&#39;t dirty the company&#39;s floor.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.812" end="00:31:24.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe wasn&#39;t just a simple gold digger.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.312" end="00:31:27.312" style="s2">Her water is much deeper than you</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:27.312" style="s2">thought.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.712" end="00:31:30.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money laundering logs?</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.312" end="00:31:32.312" style="s2">She&#39;s been colluding with an</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.212" end="00:31:33.912" style="s2">international artifact smuggling ring?</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.312" end="00:31:36.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.912" end="00:31:38.212" style="s2">She fled to the private estate of Viper,</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.112" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">a notorious smuggling boss.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.212" end="00:31:43.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are planning something massive at</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:45.512" style="s2">next week&#39;s Global Antique Summit.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.612" end="00:31:47.912" style="s2">Smuggling national treasures, I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.512" end="00:31:49.612" style="s2">let them get away with this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.912" end="00:31:51.012" style="s2">Let&#39;s uproot them all.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.612" end="00:31:53.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss Viper,</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.012" end="00:31:55.242" style="s2">Serena and Julian ruined me. You have to</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.712" end="00:31:55.712" style="s2">get revenge for me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.242" end="00:31:57.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.712" end="00:31:59.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.612" end="00:32:01.212" style="s2">Next week at the summit, the world&#39;s top</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.612" end="00:32:02.212" style="s2">appraisers and billionaires will be</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.212" end="00:32:04.512" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.212" end="00:32:06.712" style="s2">I&#39;m preparing a big surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.512" end="00:32:08.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will detonate the NINE DRAGONS CUP</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.712" end="00:32:11.512" style="s2">RIGHT IN THE CENTER OF THE HALL. When</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.812" end="00:32:15.812" style="s2">all the experts are dead, my smuggling</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.512" end="00:32:15.812" style="s2">ring will monopolize the global market.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.812" end="00:32:23.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, my fake sister, you think</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.112" end="00:32:26.112" style="s2">you won?</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.312" end="00:32:28.112" style="s2">Boss Viper can crush you like a bug.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.112" end="00:32:29.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your tone, Viper.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.112" end="00:32:32.512" style="s2">My woman is not someone you can point</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.812" end="00:32:32.512" style="s2">fingers at.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.577" end="00:32:35.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.912" end="00:32:37.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies and gentlemen, today I present to</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.512" end="00:32:39.613" style="s2">you a peerless national treasure.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.912" end="00:32:41.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Nine Dragons Cup.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.613" end="00:32:44.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, all experts come closer to</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.513" end="00:32:46.713" style="s2">appreciate.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.013" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come closer, you idiots. They</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.713" end="00:32:52.313" style="s2">stuffed A LIQUID BOMB INSIDE MY BELLY.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.013" end="00:32:53.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN. IT&#39;S GOING TO EXPLODE IN 60</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.313" end="00:32:55.813" style="s2">SECONDS.</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.613" end="00:32:58.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JULIAN, there&#39;s a bomb in that cup. He</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.813" end="00:32:58.913" style="s2">wants to kill everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.413" end="00:33:04.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security, bomb threat. Cut the power and</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.813" end="00:33:06.913" style="s2">initiate emergency evacuation</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.313" end="00:33:06.913" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.613" end="00:33:11.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T BELIEVE HER. THERE IS NO BOMB.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.313" end="00:33:14.313" style="s2">SERENA JUST WANTS TO STEAL the treasure</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.913" end="00:33:16.413" style="s2">for herself and create chaos.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.313" end="00:33:18.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 seconds. I&#39;m going to be blown to</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.413" end="00:33:18.913" style="s2">dust.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.813" end="00:33:24.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, it&#39;s too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.513" end="00:33:33.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You crazy woman, die.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.113" end="00:33:33.713" style="s2">Cut the blue wire near my base.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.113" end="00:33:41.013" style="s2">We survived.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.013" end="00:33:43.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Plan failed. RETREAT TO THE HIDDEN</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.013" end="00:33:43.413" style="s2">VAULT.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.513" end="00:33:49.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS VIPER, TAKE ME WITH YOU. I&#39;M YOUR</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.913" end="00:33:49.413" style="s2">WOMAN.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.113" end="00:33:57.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T COME CLOSER. THIS PLACE IS RIGGED</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.713" end="00:33:58.713" style="s2">WITH A TON OF C4. IF YOU PUSH ME, WE ALL</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.013" end="00:34:01.913" style="s2">DIE TOGETHER, AND THESE NATIONAL</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.713" end="00:34:01.913" style="s2">TREASURES WILL BURN WITH US.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.623" end="00:34:07.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.213" end="00:34:09.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SPIRITS OF ALL THINGS, hear my command.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.613" end="00:34:12.413" style="s2">Awaken.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.613" end="00:34:16.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been locked away for 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.413" end="00:34:16.213" style="s2">Slay this tomb robber.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.113" end="00:34:22.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MONSTERS, SHE&#39;S A MONSTER.</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.313" end="00:34:26.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything has a soul. Every sin you</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.713" end="00:34:28.613" style="s2">committed we remember, rot in hell.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.013" end="00:34:30.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The defendant, Chloe Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.613" end="00:34:32.713" style="s2">for attempted murder,</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.213" end="00:34:35.513" style="s2">massive fraud, and participating in an</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.713" end="00:34:37.913" style="s2">international artifact smuggling ring.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.513" end="00:34:40.213" style="s2">The crimes are extremely severe.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.913" end="00:34:42.314" style="s2">You are hereby sentenced to life in</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.213" end="00:34:42.814" style="s2">prison without the possibility OF</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.314" end="00:34:44.888" style="s2">PAROLE.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.814" end="00:34:45.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO. I DON&#39;T WANT TO GO TO JAIL.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.888" end="00:34:47.814" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.514" end="00:34:49.714" style="s2">I AM THE SINCLAIR HEIR.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.814" end="00:34:52.514" style="s2">LET ME OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.714" end="00:34:54.514" style="s2">I WAS SO BLIND. I treated a diva and</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.514" end="00:34:57.814" style="s2">like a treasure and I drove my real</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.514" end="00:35:01.514" style="s2">daughter away. I destroyed this family.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.814" end="00:35:01.514" style="s2">I DESERVE TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.314" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">SERENA, MY DAUGHTER, mommy regrets it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.914" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">Will you back and see me just once?</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.714" end="00:35:14.514" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a mother.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.814" end="00:35:18.114" style="s2">I only have grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.514" end="00:35:22.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, my daughter, mommy regrets it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.114" end="00:35:22.114" style="s2">Will you back and see me just once?</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.914" end="00:35:27.914" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a mother.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.914" end="00:35:27.914" style="s2">I only have grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.314" end="00:35:35.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Serena, thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.614" end="00:35:37.414" style="s2">unconditionally donating thousands of</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.214" end="00:35:39.714" style="s2">recovered global artifacts back to the</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.414" end="00:35:39.714" style="s2">state.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.914" end="00:35:46.714" style="s2">You are not just a legend in the antique</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.914" end="00:35:49.014" style="s2">world. You are a hero of our nation.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.714" end="00:35:50.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; National treasures belong to the country</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.014" end="00:35:51.714" style="s2">and to history.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.514" end="00:35:53.914" style="s2">They should never be the victims of</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.714" end="00:35:57.714" style="s2">personal greed.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.914" end="00:35:57.714" style="s2">I only did what any citizen should do.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:03.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.714" end="00:36:03.314" style="s2">We are finally home.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.214" end="00:36:12.514" style="s2">Ms. Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.314" end="00:36:15.614" style="s2">you saved the national treasures</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.514" end="00:36:15.614" style="s2">and you saved everyone today.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.614" end="00:36:20.614" style="s2">But you don&#39;t realize</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.514" end="00:36:25.514" style="s2">from the very first day I met you in</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:25.514" style="s2">that rundown antique shop, you saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.214" end="00:36:36.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s had me locked in a safe for five</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.214" end="00:36:39.714" style="s2">years just waiting for the perfect</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.014" end="00:36:40.814" style="s2">queen. Say yes, darling.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.714" end="00:36:42.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.814" end="00:36:43.514" style="s2">you&#39;ve handed the national treasures</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.114" end="00:36:44.814" style="s2">over to the country.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.514" end="00:36:45.916" style="s2">Now,</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.814" end="00:36:48.116" style="s2">are you willing to hand yourself over to</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.916" end="00:36:48.116" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.855" end="00:37:00.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.616" end="00:37:03.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, you ruthless wolf in the</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.816" end="00:37:04.716" style="s2">business world, you finally managed to</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.016" end="00:37:06.316" style="s2">catch my precious granddaughter.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.716" end="00:37:09.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, I will protect her with my</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.316" end="00:37:09.516" style="s2">life. I promise you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.016" end="00:37:13.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard about your parents and Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.916" end="00:37:16.416" style="s2">They let their greed and bias blind</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.716" end="00:37:19.216" style="s2">them. They are reaping what they sowed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.416" end="00:37:21.816" style="s2">Don&#39;t feel guilty, my child.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.216" end="00:37:23.716" style="s2">The Sinclair family&#39;s era is over. But</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.816" end="00:37:28.016" style="s2">my personal 10% shares of the global</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.716" end="00:37:28.016" style="s2">mining rights, I leave them all to you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:32.616" style="s2">Take it. Use it to do more good in the</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.416" end="00:37:34.536" style="s2">world. You are the true pride of this</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.616" end="00:37:36.556" style="s2">bloodline.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.536" end="00:37:36.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.916" end="00:37:39.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Grandpa.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
